DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
27008::$$$message_0201_0000_0000$$$::Oh yeah, I should ask her about her time in England.[lr]::
27009::$$$message_0201_0000_0001$$$::Even [font italic=true]I'm[font italic=false] a small-time spellcaster. I'm curious what the Clock Tower, the headquarters of the Mage's Association in London, is like.::
27010::$$$message_0201_0001_0000$$$::"It's just a museum.[lr]::
27011::$$$message_0201_0001_0001$$$::Oh, did you want a souvenir?"[lr]::
27012::$$$message_0201_0001_0002$$$::Tohsaka hands me a thick book.[lr]::
27013::$$$message_0201_0001_0003$$$::It's a catalog she bought on discount at the British Museum. It doesn't look very valuable.::
27014::$$$message_0201_0002_0000$$$::"...Well, I'll take it."[lr]::
27015::$$$message_0201_0002_0001$$$::With thanks, I take the book.[lr]::
27016::$$$message_0201_0002_0002$$$::"You're welcome. I might ask you for help if I'm ever having money trouble, so get ready to Project stuff other than weapons. If sculptures are too bulky, we could try paintings."[lr]::
27017::$$$message_0201_0002_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
27018::$$$message_0201_0002_0004$$$::It's just like Tohsaka to treat even souvenirs as an investment.::
27019::$$$message_0201_0003_0000$$$::"...I won't help you commit crimes.[lr]::
27020::$$$message_0201_0003_0001$$$::I bet there are appraisers who use magecraft. They'd be able to pick out my counterfeits with one look."::
27021::$$$message_0201_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, you still don't know how unique your skills are. There isn't really anyone who can tell your Projections aren't original upon initial examination.[lr]::
27022::$$$message_0201_0004_0001$$$::Practitioners who examine the structure would fail. Spirit mediums might sense something off, but that department only studies items with interesting histories. If we're just after money, we could make a killing."::
27023::$$$message_0201_0005_0000$$$::"Huh, really?"[lr]::
27024::$$$message_0201_0005_0001$$$::"Really. I'm proud of you, as your mentor."[lr]::
27025::$$$message_0201_0005_0002$$$::Ugh. I have mixed feelings about this, but the compliment makes me happy. I think.::
27026::$$$message_0201_0006_0000$$$::"Though the fallout could be pretty scary.[lr]::
27027::$$$message_0201_0006_0001$$$::We aren't Bonnie and Clyde. I'd hate for us to make the wanted list instead of money."[lr]::
27028::$$$message_0201_0006_0002$$$::"No thanks. I value my life over money."[lr]::
27029::$$$message_0201_0006_0003$$$::Also, I wouldn't want to be labeled her accomplice when she threatened me into it.::
27030::$$$message_0201_0007_0000$$$::"Yeah. It could be fun to boldly make some quick cash, but there's no point if we get found out right away. It's not like the method costs us any capital, so let's just take it one step at a time."[lr]::
27031::$$$message_0201_0007_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
27032::$$$message_0201_0007_0002$$$::She's joking. This must be one of Tohsaka's best jokes.[lr]::
27033::$$$message_0201_0007_0003$$$::I repeat it to myself three times and decide to change the subject.::
27034::$$$message_0201_0008_0000$$$::"Let's discuss business prospects another time.[lr]::
27035::$$$message_0201_0008_0001$$$::About London, did anything memorable happen? [cacheimage storage=凛私服03g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服03g(中)]Were the prices good, was the food bad, did you make any new friends, and stuff like that?"::
27036::$$$message_0201_0009_0000$$$::"You want stories instead of souvenirs?[lr]::
27037::$$$message_0201_0009_0001$$$::...Well, the Clock Tower is exactly what it sounds like, but most of the workshops are underground.[lr]::
27038::$$$message_0201_0009_0002$$$::It's a dungeon that gets crazier the lower you go.[lr]::
27039::$$$message_0201_0009_0003$$$::They call the Egyptian branch of the Association a pit, but the Clock Tower's no less mole-like."::
27040::$$$message_0201_0010_0000$$$::"...Huh. What else? Anything more serious?"[lr]::
27041::$$$message_0201_0010_0001$$$::"Hey, I didn't have time to be a tourist.[lr]::
27042::$$$message_0201_0010_0002$$$::I was scraping together the ingredients to dispose of the Jeweled Sword, reserving laboratories, greeting the Mineralogy higher-ups over and over, schmoozing with nobles who might sponsor me, finding an apartment to live in next year, checking out a student dorm that might let me stay for cheap..."[cacheimage storage=凛私服09a(中)][wvs][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服09a(中)]::
27043::$$$message_0201_0011_0000$$$::"What's wrong? You look like you just swallowed a bug."[lr]::
27044::$$$message_0201_0011_0001$$$::"...Well, when I went to tour the dorms, I met an unpleasant girl.[lr]::
27045::$$$message_0201_0011_0002$$$::Thanks to her, I've been banned from the dorms, so I have to find an actual apartment now."[lr]::
27046::$$$message_0201_0011_0003$$$::I see a blood vessel twitch on her temple.[lr]::
27047::$$$message_0201_0011_0004$$$::Tohsaka never minces words, but I think this might be the first time I've heard her describe someone that way.::
27048::$$$message_0201_0012_0000$$$::"Is this unpleasant girl our age?"[lr]::
27049::$$$message_0201_0012_0001$$$::"Huh? W-why?"[lr]::
27050::$$$message_0201_0012_0002$$$::"Just wondering. It feels rare for you to describe someone like that."[lr]::
27051::$$$message_0201_0012_0003$$$::Her vicious tone made this person sound like her equal, or to be blunt, someone just like her.::
27052::$$$message_0201_0013_0000$$$::"...Yeah, she is.[lr]::
27053::$$$message_0201_0013_0001$$$::I ran into her at reception. We just made small talk at first. She was polite and witty, so she gave off a good first impression.[lr]::
27054::$$$message_0201_0013_0002$$$::I could say something about her fashion sense, but she was obviously rich. I didn't think she had such bad taste [font italic=true]yet[font italic=false]."::
27055::$$$message_0201_0014_0000$$$::I can sense the hatred behind that "yet."[lr]::
27056::$$$message_0201_0014_0001$$$::The voltage of Tohsaka's annoyance rises, and I can even feel her magical energy rising, not just her veins. She's tense.[lr]::
27057::$$$message_0201_0014_0002$$$::Now...[lr]::
27058::$$$message_0201_0014_0003$$$::Tohsaka's account from here contains a bunch of foul language, so let's visualize how it happened, instead.::
27059::$$$message_0201_0015_0000$$$::"...It was the worst incident in our dorm's history.[sestop time=200 storage=se666.wav][lr]::
27060::$$$message_0201_0015_0001$$$::Miss Tohsaka and Lady Luviagelita.[sestop time=200 storage=se666.wav][lr]::
27061::$$$message_0201_0015_0002$$$::This has gone far beyond the point of debating whose fault it was.[sestop time=200 storage=se666.wav][se storage=se667.wav][lr]::
27062::$$$message_0201_0015_0003$$$::The lesson that future generations must learn is to never, ever put them in the same room..."[sestop time=200 storage=se666.wav][lr]::
27063::$$$message_0201_0015_0004$$$::-Testimony of receptionist Octavia Reyland, August 8, 200x.[sestop time=200 storage=se666.wav][se storage=se667.wav]::
27064::$$$message_0201_0016_0000$$$::"I can take that application for you.[lr]::
27065::$$$message_0201_0016_0001$$$::Please wait while I find a room that can accommodate your request."::
27066::$$$message_0201_0017_0000$$$::"Haah, I made it.[lr]::
27067::$$$message_0201_0017_0001$$$::Now, I just have to wait for the assessment... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=200 storage=凛私服06b(中)]Hm?"::
27068::$$$message_0201_0018_0000$$$::"Pardon me. May I?[lr]::
27069::$$$message_0201_0018_0001$$$::This is the counter for next year's applications, yes?"::
27070::$$$message_0201_0019_0000$$$::"Y-yes, go ahead. I'm sorry for standing in your way. If you want to apply, you should hurry[line len=2]"::
27071::$$$message_0201_0020_0000$$$::"I'm well aware. It ends in seven minutes, correct?[lr]::
27072::$$$message_0201_0020_0001$$$::It seems neither of us has adjusted to the time here yet."::
27073::$$$message_0201_0021_0000$$$::"You there. Are these all the documents I need?"::
27074::$$$message_0201_0022_0000$$$::"Ah yes, that will do, lady.[lr]::
27075::$$$message_0201_0022_0001$$$::I'll accept your application, so you can come back in[line len=2]Ah, I believe our capacity increased by one."::
27076::$$$message_0201_0023_0000$$$::"I apologize. Please wait a moment.[lr]::
27077::$$$message_0201_0023_0001$$$::I'll double check this right away."::
27078::$$$message_0201_0024_0000$$$::"..."::
27079::$$$message_0201_0025_0000$$$::"..."::
27080::$$$message_0201_0026_0000$$$::"......"::
27081::$$$message_0201_0027_0000$$$::"......"::
27082::$$$message_0201_0028_0000$$$::"......Um..."[wvs][nolr][wait canskip=0 time=300]::
27083::$$$message_0201_0028_0001$$$::"......Hey..."::
27084::$$$message_0201_0029_0000$$$::"Sorry, go ahead.[lr]::
27085::$$$message_0201_0029_0001$$$::Or should I speak first?"::
27086::$$$message_0201_0030_0000$$$::"It's all right. I appreciate your thoughtfulness.[lr]::
27087::$$$message_0201_0030_0001$$$::May I ask you a question?"::
27088::$$$message_0201_0031_0000$$$::"Of course.[lr]::
27089::$$$message_0201_0031_0001$$$::We both have nothing else to do. Perhaps it's fate that we met each other today."::
27090::$$$message_0201_0032_0000$$$::"I agree... Hehe. This is just a hunch, but I thought from first glance that we'd get along."::
27091::$$$message_0201_0033_0000$$$::"For those of us engaged in magecraft, the intuition of a first impression can be as concrete as foreknowledge."::
27092::$$$message_0201_0034_0000$$$::"Oh my. If we're talking foreknowledge and not prediction, then your intuition must be impressive, indeed."::
27093::$$$message_0201_0035_0000$$$::"Besides...I doubt that your instincts have been wrong so far."::
27094::$$$message_0201_0036_0000$$$::"Oh? Does your own intuition tell you that?"::
27095::$$$message_0201_0037_0000$$$::"Yes. We sensed that we were kindred spirits and opened up to each other, so we can't both be wrong.[lr]::
27096::$$$message_0201_0037_0001$$$::After all, I also..."::
27097::$$$message_0201_0038_0000$$$::"Have an intuition that doesn't miss?"::
27098::$$$message_0201_0039_0000$$$::"...Hehe. Yes, your instincts are correct.[lr]::
27099::$$$message_0201_0039_0001$$$::I've never misjudged someone's character upon the first meeting."::
27100::$$$message_0201_0040_0000$$$::"How confident of you.[lr]::
27101::$$$message_0201_0040_0001$$$::And what's your impression of me?[lr]::
27102::$$$message_0201_0040_0002$$$::What sort of person am I in your eyes?"::
27103::$$$message_0201_0041_0000$$$::"A formidable competitor worthy of respect, shall we say."::
27104::$$$message_0201_0042_0000$$$::"You also seem to be a new student. This is my first time speaking to someone from the Orient.[lr]::
27105::$$$message_0201_0042_0001$$$::Pardon my rudeness, but are you Chinese?"::
27106::$$$message_0201_0043_0000$$$::"You're just guessing. What makes you think that?"::
27107::$$$message_0201_0044_0000$$$::"The way you walk and move your center of gravity, perhaps. I received lessons in such things long ago.[lr]::
27108::$$$message_0201_0044_0001$$$::From a master in my homeland, of course."::
27109::$$$message_0201_0045_0000$$$::"I see.[lr]::
27110::$$$message_0201_0045_0001$$$::But your homeland is... Apologies. Let me answer your question first."::
27111::$$$message_0201_0046_0000$$$::"Sorry to disappoint, but I'm Japanese.[lr]::
27112::$$$message_0201_0046_0001$$$::Only by a quarter, though."::
27113::$$$message_0201_0047_0000$$$::"...You're Japanese, then.[lr]::
27114::$$$message_0201_0047_0001$$$::I suppose I can't always be right. I'll take it as a sign that I should perhaps get to know you better."::
27115::$$$message_0201_0048_0000$$$::"A pleasure to meet you, new student from the Orient.[lr]::
27116::$$$message_0201_0048_0001$$$::My homeland happens to be Finland."::
27117::$$$message_0201_0049_0000$$$::"It's just a stone's throw from here, compared to yours.[lr]::
27118::$$$message_0201_0049_0001$$$::Japan is at the far edge of the world, right? [cacheimage storage=ルヴィア01f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ルヴィア01f(中)]Did you come here all by yourself?"::
27119::$$$message_0201_0050_0000$$$::"My parents are deceased. I don't completely lack for next of kin, but I plan to enroll at the Clock Tower next year.[lr]::
27120::$$$message_0201_0050_0001$$$::Is it unusual to see Asians in London?"::
27121::$$$message_0201_0051_0000$$$::"I hear there aren't many, but they're all renowned as first-rate mages.[lr]::
27122::$$$message_0201_0051_0001$$$::Proof enough that race is no handicap."::
27123::$$$message_0201_0052_0000$$$::"I'm glad to hear that.[lr]::
27124::$$$message_0201_0052_0001$$$::If I'm being honest, I feel a little lonely."::
27125::$$$message_0201_0053_0000$$$::"I'm only visiting for a month to get the lay of the land, but everyone I meet is a monster."::
27126::$$$message_0201_0054_0000$$$::"Even a tengu's nose would break... Oh, sorry. You probably don't understand that idiom."::
27127::$$$message_0201_0055_0000$$$::"I do know what a tengu is, though. [wvs][wait canskip=0 time=400][lr]::
27128::$$$message_0201_0055_0001$$$::It's a type of horned Japanese hermit, right?"::
27129::$$$message_0201_0056_0000$$$::"I would interpret that idiom to describe someone powerful feeling humbled before an even greater power... Is that correct?"::
27130::$$$message_0201_0057_0000$$$::"Yeah. Your interpretation isn't wrong.[lr]::
27131::$$$message_0201_0057_0001$$$::It means that I was confident in my hometown, but I've had to adjust my attitude since leaving home."::
27132::$$$message_0201_0058_0000$$$::"You too?[lr]::
27133::$$$message_0201_0058_0001$$$::I've actually been feeling the same way.[lr]::
27134::$$$message_0201_0058_0002$$$::...We really do see eye to eye."::
27135::$$$message_0201_0059_0000$$$::"Hey, you're moving out here alone, right?[lr]::
27136::$$$message_0201_0059_0001$$$::In that case..."::
27137::$$$message_0201_0060_0000$$$::"Thank you for waiting.[lr]::
27138::$$$message_0201_0060_0001$$$::Lady Luviagelita Edelfelt, might I have a moment?"::
27139::$$$message_0201_0061_0000$$$::"...What terrible timing.[lr]::
27140::$$$message_0201_0061_0001$$$::Did I forget to fill something out?"::
27141::$$$message_0201_0062_0000$$$::"No, there was no problem with the documents...but circumstances have changed in the last seven days."::
27142::$$$message_0201_0063_0000$$$::"To be brief, we cannot honor your request.[lr]::
27143::$$$message_0201_0063_0001$$$::You wrote that you wanted to use the entire top floor, but we just received an application to move in there..."::
27144::$$$message_0201_0064_0000$$$::"An application to move in?[lr]::
27145::$$$message_0201_0064_0001$$$::I thought it was well-known that the Edelfelts have claimed this dormitory."::
27146::$$$message_0201_0065_0000$$$::"What backwater garden mage would come all this way to submit an application and ruin my day?"::
27147::$$$message_0201_0066_0000$$$::"Um... That young lady there.[lr]::
27148::$$$message_0201_0066_0001$$$::She's been admitted on a Lord's recommendation half a year ago, and the Edelfelts' authority can't overrule that."::
27149::$$$message_0201_0067_0000$$$::"...[cacheimage storage=ルヴィア01e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=800][chgfg time=300 storage=ルヴィア01e(中)]Very well.[lr]::
27150::$$$message_0201_0067_0001$$$::While I cannot overlook this insult to my house, I won't dismiss the idea of a roommate."::
27151::$$$message_0201_0068_0000$$$::"Um...you wouldn't need to share a room. She would only be using one of the 28 rooms that you reserved..."::
27152::$$$message_0201_0069_0000$$$::"Yes? Isn't that what a roommate is?"::
27153::$$$message_0201_0070_0000$$$::"When two people share a common living space, what else are they but roommates?[lr]::
27154::$$$message_0201_0070_0001$$$::She isn't my personal servant."::
27155::$$$message_0201_0071_0000$$$::"Ah... Haha, ha..."::
27156::$$$message_0201_0072_0000$$$::"...Well, it can't be helped.[lr]::
27157::$$$message_0201_0072_0001$$$::I would normally never allow it, but fortunately I've gained a chance to deepen our friendship."::
27158::$$$message_0201_0073_0000$$$::"So? Not a bad proposition is it, being my roommate?"::
27159::$$$message_0201_0074_0000$$$::"Not at all... I don't have a problem with it... You must be quite wealthy."::
27160::$$$message_0201_0075_0000$$$::"Of course.[lr]::
27161::$$$message_0201_0075_0001$$$::You there. Mark us down as roommates... [cacheimage storage=ルヴィア03b(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ルヴィア03b(中)]Ah, we haven't introduced ourselves yet."::
27162::$$$message_0201_0076_0000$$$::"I am Luviagelita Edelfelt. And you are?"::
27163::$$$message_0201_0077_0000$$$::"Rin Tohsaka, from Japan. I'll be joining the Mineralogy department."::
27164::$$$message_0201_0078_0000$$$::"Tohsaka...?[lr]::
27165::$$$message_0201_0078_0001$$$::Wait, if I recall, that sounds like..."::
27166::$$$message_0201_0079_0000$$$::"Miss Tohsaka, please sign here."::
27167::$$$message_0201_0080_0000$$$::"!? W-wait, [cacheimage storage=ルヴィア01f(中)][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=594 top=45 time=300 accel=3 storage=ルヴィア01f(中)]let me see that contract!"[se storage=se521.wav]::
27168::$$$message_0201_0081_0000$$$::"Whoa, what are you doing? That's my...!"::
27169::$$$message_0201_0082_0000$$$::"Tohsaka... Japan... Fuyuki... Rin Tohsaka...[cacheimage storage=凛私服03f(中),11爆発,ルヴィア01h(近),iイギリス女子寮][wvl][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][stoplquake layer=all][se volume=80 storage=se160.wav][rep rule=走る感じ(下から) fliplr=0 tops=,0, storages=凛私服03f(中),11爆発,ルヴィア01h(近) time=200 flipud=0 opacities=,200, lefts=,0, poss=l,,rc bg=iイギリス女子寮 indexes=1000,2000,3000][quake vmax=30 hmax=10 time=1200] T-Tohsaka!?"[skip_next_tag][br]::
27170::$$$message_0201_0083_0000$$$::"Hey...seriously, what's wrong?[lr]::
27171::$$$message_0201_0083_0001$$$::I've been thinking you don't have much common sense, but why are you[line len=2]"::
27172::$$$message_0201_0084_0000$$$::"Silence![lr]::
27173::$$$message_0201_0084_0001$$$::H-h-h-h-how dare you try such a dastardly plot!"::
27174::$$$message_0201_0085_0000$$$::"To think that you were the daughter of those cowardly, cowardly, cowardly Tohsakas who used a so-called Holy Grail to lure mages to your land and betrayed them all...!"::
27175::$$$message_0201_0086_0000$$$::"Hold on, what did you just say?[lr]::
27176::$$$message_0201_0086_0001$$$::Do you know about the Fuyuki Holy Grail War?"::
27177::$$$message_0201_0087_0000$$$::"Oh yes, I know about Fuyuki, all right.[lr]::
27178::$$$message_0201_0087_0001$$$::I've looked into the caliber of Japanese mages, including your ancestors."::
27179::$$$message_0201_0088_0000$$$::"And I was utterly disappointed.[lr]::
27180::$$$message_0201_0088_0001$$$::Occasionally, you produce a rare specimen, but otherwise you're an inferior race, unworthy to study Mystics."::
27181::$$$message_0201_0089_0000$$$::"What?[lr]::
27182::$$$message_0201_0089_0001$$$::I don't care what aristocrat you are, but I can't let that slide."::
27183::$$$message_0201_0090_0000$$$::"Nor should you.[lr]::
27184::$$$message_0201_0090_0001$$$::Know this[line len=2]there isn't a drop of noble blood in your veins."::
27185::$$$message_0201_0091_0000$$$::"I don't know what folly led to your clan learning magecraft, but you need to learn your place."::
27186::$$$message_0201_0092_0000$$$::"You there. Cancel what I said.[lr]::
27187::$$$message_0201_0092_0001$$$::There is no place for her on my floor."::
27188::$$$message_0201_0093_0000$$$::"You hear me?[lr]::
27189::$$$message_0201_0093_0001$$$::In the name of the Edelfelts, I declare this document..."::
27190::$$$message_0201_0094_0000$$$::"Ah. Eh. Huh?"::
27191::$$$message_0201_0095_0000$$$::"...utter [wvl][se storage=se672.wav]rubbish!"::
27192::$$$message_0201_0096_0000$$$::"Eek! Lady Edelfelt, what are you doing!?[wvs][se storage=se672.wav][lr]::
27193::$$$message_0201_0096_0001$$$::No one has ever destroyed a recommendation letter from a Lord in this dormitory's history!"::
27194::$$$message_0201_0097_0000$$$::"...(shock)"::
27195::$$$message_0201_0098_0000$$$::"Ohohohoho![lr]::
27196::$$$message_0201_0098_0001$$$::What do you have to say now, self-declared mage!?"::
27197::$$$message_0201_0099_0000$$$::"You aren't worthy of this place! [cacheimage storage=ルヴィア01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=ルヴィア01i(中)]Why don't you go back to your dirty, tiny island?"::
27198::$$$message_0201_0100_0000$$$::"Y-you anachronistic ringlets![lr]::
27199::$$$message_0201_0100_0001$$$::Did I mishear you when you claimed you weren't a racist!?"::
27200::$$$message_0201_0101_0000$$$::"Hmph! You may be Oriental, but Japanese people are a different story."::
27201::$$$message_0201_0102_0000$$$::"This whole time, you've looked so lonely, like an abandoned field mouse. I simply took [font italic=true]pity[font italic=false] on you."::
27202::$$$message_0201_0103_0000$$$::"But that ends here.[lr]::
27203::$$$message_0201_0103_0001$$$::Now that I know you're the spawn of those inhuman Tohsakas, all you'll get from me is boiling water and Gandr."::
27204::$$$message_0201_0104_0000$$$::"...That's quite the mouth on you, but it helped me remember who you are."::
27205::$$$message_0201_0105_0000$$$::"Edelfelt.[lr]::
27206::$$$message_0201_0105_0001$$$::Right, it sounded familiar. Those Edelfelts."::
27207::$$$message_0201_0106_0000$$$::"The Edelfelts from the third war. Those idiotic nobles who dropped out early after infighting, was it?"::
27208::$$$message_0201_0107_0000$$$::"Given how personally you're taking this, they must have taught their kids to hate and fear the scary Tohsakas."::
27209::$$$message_0201_0108_0000$$$::"Rrgh...![lr]::
27210::$$$message_0201_0108_0001$$$::It seems your only skill is telling terrible jokes.[lr]::
27211::$$$message_0201_0108_0002$$$::There's no taking back what you just said."::
27212::$$$message_0201_0109_0000$$$::"That's my line.[lr]::
27213::$$$message_0201_0109_0001$$$::I won't forgive you even if you get on your knees and beg, you pure, innocent rich girl."::
27214::$$$message_0201_0110_0000$$$::"...You've lit a fire in me.[lr]::
27215::$$$message_0201_0110_0001$$$::It can't be extinguished.[lr]::
27216::$$$message_0201_0110_0002$$$::Do you have the mettle to take up the glove!?"::
27217::$$$message_0201_0111_0000$$$::"Bring it on. I'll take that tacky dress while we're at it."::
27218::$$$message_0201_0112_0000$$$::"Well said.[lr]::
27219::$$$message_0201_0112_0001$$$::We have one room and two residents.[lr]::
27220::$$$message_0201_0112_0002$$$::There's only one thing left to do now."::
27221::$$$message_0201_0113_0000$$$::"Yeah. The loser gives way to the winner.[lr]::
27222::$$$message_0201_0113_0001$$$::That's a universal rule in every country."::
27223::$$$message_0201_0114_0000$$$::"D-d-d-d-don't burn this place down!!![lr]::
27224::$$$message_0201_0114_0001$$$::Not in here! It's absolutely not allowed!"::
27225::$$$message_0201_0115_0000$$$::"What are you two thinking!? This is the Norwich Dormitory, a place of peace and propriety! Magecraft activities are forbidden, to say nothing of personal duels!"::
27226::$$$message_0201_0116_0000$$$::"Relax. I'm the proud matriarch of the Edelfelts."::
27227::$$$message_0201_0117_0000$$$::"No matter who I face, I can deal with them with flesh alone. No need for magecraft.[lr]::
27228::$$$message_0201_0117_0001$$$::Is that agreeable to you, Miss Tohsaka?"::
27229::$$$message_0201_0118_0000$$$::"You asked for it.[lr]::
27230::$$$message_0201_0118_0001$$$::So you're going to fight me in close quarters without magecraft, in that dress?"::
27231::$$$message_0201_0119_0000$$$::"I don't mind if you even use your vaunted Gandr.[lr]::
27232::$$$message_0201_0119_0001$$$::I'm happy to fight bare-handed like a proper mage."::
27233::$$$message_0201_0120_0000$$$::"That's a good attitude, for a Tohsaka.[lr]::
27234::$$$message_0201_0120_0001$$$::I've slightly changed my opinion of you."::
27235::$$$message_0201_0121_0000$$$::"But don't worry.[lr]::
27236::$$$message_0201_0121_0001$$$::A dress like this, in my hands..."::
27237::$$$message_0201_0122_0000$$$::"!?"::
27238::$$$message_0201_0123_0000$$$::"Fuh, [cacheimage storage=white,iイギリス女子寮,ルヴィア02a(近)][wvl][fadein textoff=0 time=200 storage=white][clfg][se storage=se673.wav][fg index=1000 pos=c storage=iイギリス女子寮][fg index=2000 pos=rc storage=ルヴィア02a(近)][dash textoff=0 mx=-111 page=back opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=239 imag=2.4 time=300 cy=570 mag=1.4 my=-173 rot=-0.0 accel=3][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=-10][transex textoff=0 time=200][se storage=se673.wav]sei!!!"::
27239::$$$message_0201_0124_0000$$$::"What do you think? As you can see, it's easy to convert it for combat use, I must say!"::
27240::$$$message_0201_0125_0000$$$::"W-what the heck is that dress!?[lr]::
27241::$$$message_0201_0125_0001$$$::I-it had attachments and could go sleeveless all along...!?"::
27242::$$$message_0201_0126_0000$$$::"Of course. A lady has her tastes to uphold."::
27243::$$$message_0201_0127_0000$$$::"You could search the whole world and not find anyone else with tastes like that."::
27244::$$$message_0201_0128_0000$$$::"I just said they're [font italic=true]my[font italic=false] tastes![lr]::
27245::$$$message_0201_0128_0001$$$::Do you know how much the tailoring fees would be if I tore my dress every time I get into a fight!?"::
27246::$$$message_0201_0129_0000$$$::"...Were you tearing it off every time?"::
27247::$$$message_0201_0130_0000$$$::"Ah...no, ahem.[lr]::
27248::$$$message_0201_0130_0001$$$::The head of a noble family never knows when she might be ambushed."::
27249::$$$message_0201_0131_0000$$$::"This is just my way of staying prepared."::
27250::$$$message_0201_0132_0000$$$::"..."::
27251::$$$message_0201_0133_0000$$$::"W-what is that incredulous look you're giving me...![lr]::
27252::$$$message_0201_0133_0001$$$::Fine, if you don't believe me, then I'll make you understand!"::
27253::$$$message_0201_0134_0000$$$::"(She took a stance![lr]::
27254::$$$message_0201_0134_0001$$$::That stability and forward-leaning stance...she's got skills!)"::
27255::$$$message_0201_0135_0000$$$::"Hmph. Looks like you know a thing or two, Luviagelita.[lr]::
27256::$$$message_0201_0135_0001$$$::Your fashion sense aside, this means I don't have to hold back when I kick your butt."::
27257::$$$message_0201_0136_0000$$$::"The feeling is mutual.[lr]::
27258::$$$message_0201_0136_0001$$$::You're lucky this is a wooden floor, Miss Tohsaka."::
27259::$$$message_0201_0137_0000$$$::"Eeeek! Hello, hello, Mister Anthony? Mayday! Something dangerous has appeared in the dormitory! I-I don't want another pay cut. My salary is low enough!"::
27260::$$$message_0201_0138_0000$$$::"I apologize, Miss Octavia.[lr]::
27261::$$$message_0201_0138_0001$$$::But there's no need to worry. [cacheimage storage=凛私服16b(近),ルヴィア02g(中)][wvl][se storage=se083.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=625 top=65 time=300 accel=3 storage=凛私服16b(近)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=-123 top=45 time=300 accel=0 storage=ルヴィア02g(中)]I'll end this with the first strike!"::
27262::$$$message_0201_0139_0000$$$::"Kyaaaah!? M-Miss Tohsaka, where did you learn such wonderful kung fu at your age!?"::
27263::$$$message_0201_0140_0000$$$::"Marvelous! Your personal twist on it is fearsome, but you've achieved an amazing bengquan with your stature!"::
27264::$$$message_0201_0141_0000$$$::"(Got her![lr]::
27265::$$$message_0201_0141_0001$$$::At this range, victory is mine!)"::
27266::$$$message_0201_0142_0000$$$::"...Heh. How naïve, Miss Tohsaka!"::
27267::$$$message_0201_0143_0000$$$::"Huh!? No way. From behind!?"::
27268::$$$message_0201_0144_0000$$$::"Say whaaaat!?[lr]::
27269::$$$message_0201_0144_0001$$$::Luviagelita just assumed a low battle stance, sinking her hips to the ground![lr]::
27270::$$$message_0201_0144_0002$$$::That's unmistakably catch-as-catch-can!"::
27271::$$$message_0201_0145_0000$$$::"The ancient English grappling techniques from Lancashire!"::
27272::$$$message_0201_0146_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"::
27273::$$$message_0201_0147_0000$$$::"Your back is mine!"::
27274::$$$message_0201_0148_0000$$$::"No way... Pro wrestling!? You're insane!"::
27275::$$$message_0201_0149_0000$$$::"She lands it! The rising star of Finland, the hound of the ring, the lady forklift, LUVIAGELITA EDELFELT!"::
27276::$$$message_0201_0150_0000$$$::"There we have it, a knockout in the first round, in 13 seconds![lr]::
27277::$$$message_0201_0150_0001$$$::An unbelievable fighter has appeared!!!"::
27278::$$$message_0201_0151_0000$$$::"...It's a three-count.[lr]::
27279::$$$message_0201_0151_0001$$$::Miss Tohsaka, you lost because you showed your hand too soon. The fight doesn't begin until the gong sounds, you know."::
27280::$$$message_0201_0152_0000$$$::"Huurgh... Stars... I see stars..."::
27281::$$$message_0201_0153_0000$$$::"Uh... [wvl canskip=0 time=500]Damn."[lr]::
27282::$$$message_0201_0153_0001$$$::Her opponent sounds amazing, but so is Tohsaka for not hesitating to pick a fight.[lr]::
27283::$$$message_0201_0153_0002$$$::You can tell she's got a record.[lr]::
27284::$$$message_0201_0153_0003$$$::A dormitory is different from our school campus, but it clearly isn't Tohsaka's first time fighting at school.::
27285::$$$message_0201_0154_0000$$$::"Then you went for round two, which just turned into a dirty fight.[lr]::
27286::$$$message_0201_0154_0001$$$::When you calmed down, the lobby was trashed, and both of you got punished... You know, it sounds like you got yourself banned from that dorm."[lr]::
27287::$$$message_0201_0154_0002$$$::"It wasn't my fault![lr]::
27288::$$$message_0201_0154_0003$$$::If Luvia hadn't come at me, I wouldn't have gotten a dishonorable nickname before even starting school!"::
27289::$$$message_0201_0155_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
27290::$$$message_0201_0155_0001$$$::While I'm curious about this nickname, I can already tell it has something to do with beasts or typhoons.[lr]::
27291::$$$message_0201_0155_0002$$$::"...What are you grinning at? Got something to say to me?"::
27292::$$$message_0201_0156_0000$$$::"Yeah. But don't get mad. I'm just saying what I feel.[lr]::
27293::$$$message_0201_0156_0001$$$::Um, this Luvia girl sounds like a good match for you.[lr]::
27294::$$$message_0201_0156_0002$$$::Like you met a friend you get along with, [cacheimage storage=凛fd特殊04a(中),m02タイガーぱんちb][wvl][se storage=se101.wav][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=200 storage=凛fd特殊04a(中) last=凛私服12b(中)]ow!"[se storage=se229.wav][se storage=se230.wav][quake vmax=30 hmax=10 time=1200][fadein time=200 storage=m02タイガーぱんちb][texton][lr]::
27295::$$$message_0201_0156_0003$$$::I can see them![lr]::
27296::$$$message_0201_0156_0004$$$::I haven't seen stars like that in a while!::
27297::$$$message_0201_0157_0000$$$::"...Argh, I nailed that so well.[lr]::
27298::$$$message_0201_0157_0001$$$::If only I pulled this off back then, I wouldn't have eaten that back drop...!"[lr]::
27299::$$$message_0201_0157_0002$$$::She shakes her fist.[lr]::
27300::$$$message_0201_0157_0003$$$::Oh, so this Luvia lady finished her off with a back drop...::
27301::$$$message_0201_0158_0000$$$::"And why did you just hit me with that?"[lr]::
27302::$$$message_0201_0158_0001$$$::"Hehe. My body just reacted when you said the one thing I didn't want to hear."[lr]::
27303::$$$message_0201_0158_0002$$$::...They do say we're defined by the people we associate with.[lr]::
27304::$$$message_0201_0158_0003$$$::Tohsaka's violence score has clearly gone up since meeting Luvia.::
27305::$$$message_0201_0159_0000$$$::"...Hmph. Just to be clear before you get the wrong idea, I'll never be friends with Luvia.[lr]::
27306::$$$message_0201_0159_0001$$$::She hates Japanese people, and her hobby is bullying Japanese people. She threw a glove at me in the end."[lr]::
27307::$$$message_0201_0159_0002$$$::"Wow, a glove? That's so old school."[lr]::
27308::$$$message_0201_0159_0003$$$::Still, she does sound like a straightforward sort.[lr]::
27309::$$$message_0201_0159_0004$$$::If Tohsaka had been raised in England, I have no doubt she would have thrown a glove at me at some point.::
27310::$$$message_0201_0160_0000$$$::"That's kind of extreme. Does she have a grudge against Japan?"::
27311::$$$message_0201_0161_0000$$$::"Yeah. She... Her name's Luviagelita Edelfelt. Edelfelt is a famous, noble house.[lr]::
27312::$$$message_0201_0161_0001$$$::They're aristocrats, but they train their people like mercenaries. They always happily show up when there's conflict, and they're feared as 'the world's most beautiful hyenas' for being glory hounds."::
27313::$$$message_0201_0162_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=800][say storage=emimp15_shi_0180 name=士郎]You know...those descriptions are starting to sound familiar."[lr]::
27314::$$$message_0201_0162_0001$$$::"Shut up and listen![wm canskip=0][lr]::
27315::$$$message_0201_0162_0002$$$::Since they love fighting, they joined a ritual on an island country in the Far East out of curiosity.[lr]::
27316::$$$message_0201_0162_0003$$$::It was sixty years ago. The Edelfelts were led by twin sisters at the time. They were renowned mages, but they suffered a crushing defeat. Only one of the sisters survived."::
27317::$$$message_0201_0163_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
27318::$$$message_0201_0163_0001$$$::The light-hearted story suddenly becomes grim.[lr]::
27319::$$$message_0201_0163_0002$$$::Edelfelt.[lr]::
27320::$$$message_0201_0163_0003$$$::Twin matriarchs.[lr]::
27321::$$$message_0201_0163_0004$$$::And, a ritual on an island in the Far East, sixty years ago.::
27322::$$$message_0201_0164_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, you mean..."[lr]::
27323::$$$message_0201_0164_0001$$$::"The Third Holy Grail War. That's why Luvia hates Japanese people.[lr]::
27324::$$$message_0201_0164_0002$$$::But they really underestimated us. Those twin matriarchs hated each other's guts, apparently. I heard rumors that the younger sister's death was due to the sisters falling out."::
27325::$$$message_0201_0165_0000$$$::"...Oh yeah. If I recall correctly, they built mansions here to spite the Einzberns. Like a hideout in a forest.[lr]::
27326::$$$message_0201_0165_0001$$$::Apparently, the sisters built them separately. I wonder if they couldn't stand to breathe the same air."::
27327::$$$message_0201_0166_0000$$$::Hideout in a forest...?[lr]::
27328::$$$message_0201_0166_0001$$$::And separate houses...?::
27329::$$$message_0201_0167_0000$$$::"Mansions built sixty years ago... Then this Luvia has a house somewhere in Fuyuki?"[lr]::
27330::$$$message_0201_0167_0001$$$::"Oh. That makes sense.[lr]::
27331::$$$message_0201_0167_0002$$$::But it's been long abandoned. Apparently, the Edelfelts were said to have never set foot in Japan again, and I think they handed the buildings over to the Mage's Association."::
27332::$$$message_0201_0168_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
27333::$$$message_0201_0168_0001$$$::It falls into place.[lr]::
27334::$$$message_0201_0168_0002$$$::I don't know exactly what just fell into place, but it's a big piece of a puzzle.::
27335::$$$message_0201_0169_0000$$$::"...I think I know where that mage hideout is.[lr]::
27336::$$$message_0201_0169_0001$$$::In the war half a year ago, Kotomine backstabbed a Master, right?"::
27337::$$$message_0201_0170_0000$$$::"Yeah. The Association sent a mage, and Kirei stole their Command Spells.[lr]::
27338::$$$message_0201_0170_0001$$$::We found a hideout when we were trying to find Lancer's Master, remember?"::
27339::$$$message_0201_0171_0000$$$::"Yeah. There were bloodstains and a severed arm missing its Command Spells on the floor. If that mansion belonged to the Edelfelts...that would make it the second one."::
27340::$$$message_0201_0172_0000$$$::"It would. The sisters were outsiders who built mansions on a foreign battlefield. It almost sounds like a famous landmark if you call them the Edelfelt Twin Mansions.[lr]::
27341::$$$message_0201_0172_0001$$$::The one I found was close to my house. I don't know where the other one is."[lr]::
27342::$$$message_0201_0172_0002$$$::"Hang on. Near your house? In Miyama, then?"::
27343::$$$message_0201_0173_0000$$$::"Yeah. Right under my nose. [cacheimage storage=凛私服06g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服06g(中)]They've got a lot of nerve, building mansions on Tohsaka turf."[lr]::
27344::$$$message_0201_0173_0001$$$::   She's right.[lr]::
27345::$$$message_0201_0173_0002$$$::Looking back, this mistake was [font italic=true]someone's[font italic=false] biggest misdirection.::
27346::$$$message_0201_0174_0000$$$::"You seem interested, Emiya.[lr]::
27347::$$$message_0201_0174_0001$$$::Should we go check it out next week on our time off?"[lr]::
27348::$$$message_0201_0174_0002$$$::"...Yeah. That sounds like it wouldn't be a bad idea, once this mess is over."::
27349::$$$message_0201_0175_0000$$$::I answer absently, fighting the dizziness.[lr]::
27350::$$$message_0201_0175_0001$$$::Tohsaka continues her travel stories.[lr]::
27351::$$$message_0201_0175_0002$$$::The story of the Edelfelts was no longer brought up.::
927191::$$$message_9201_0095_0000$$$::"...utter rubbish!"[r]::

